{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16103240","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16103240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1610324001:1":{"text":"솔라 다이얼 안에 서 있던 사람이, 강렬한 빛과 함께 사라졌다고?","source_cn":"有人站在日时仪里面，强光一闪，人就没了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D06AA7C93AC386E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1610324002:1":{"text":"그렇다니까! 우리가 봤어!","source_cn":"对对对！我们看到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A322606E550D77B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610324003:1":{"text":"카세디아, 그로웬. 너희는 어떻게 생각해?","source_cn":"科丝蒂，格墨文，你们怎么看？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAFA341BEB5F9EC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610324004:1":{"text":"음... 텔레포트 마법인 것 같은데.","source_cn":"嗯……听上去像是传送魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9722DA8873D0D453","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610324005:1":{"text":"나도 아까 거기 서 있었는데 아무 일도 없었어. 매개체의 도움이 있어야 발동되는 텔레포트 마법일지도 몰라.","source_cn":"我刚才也站在那里，什么事都发生，看来需要借助媒介启动传...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4DD188D39FD9566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610324006:1":{"text":"어쩌면... 이게 시험 내용일지도 몰라. 이번 선발 시험은 이미 시작된 걸 수도 있어.","source_cn":"也许……这就是考试的内容。这场选拔，说不定已经开始了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AF8C72003285F28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610324007:1":{"text":"좋아. 그럼 솔라 다이얼을 자세히 관찰해 보자.","source_cn":"好，那我们再去仔细观察一下日时仪吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA695C2F90222936B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:休":{"text":"실벤","source":"休","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:马尔斯":{"text":"마르스","source":"马尔斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格墨文":{"text":"그로웬","source":"格墨文","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:科丝蒂":{"text":"카세디아","source":"科丝蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":4}}